ns only; skating rentals and individual events can carry separate costs.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"canyon-lake-park","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"Canyon Lake Park","title":"Walk or bike around Canyon Lake Park","subtitle":"Rapid City","notes":"Bring a friend for a lap around the lake or a casual bike ride, and use the open park setting for a picnic or a simple outdoor break.","short_summary":"A free lakeside park for walking and biking.","evidence_claim":"Visit Rapid City includes Canyon Lake Park in its free activities and describes walking and biking around the lake.","source_url":"https://www.visitrapidcity.com/blog/post/33-fun-free-things-to-do-in-rapid-city-and-the-black-hills/","source_title":"33 Fun Free Things To Do In Rapid City And The Black Hills","source_kind":"cultural_institution","source_published_at":"2026-06-26","source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Rapid City municipal parks are open 5 a.m.–10 p.m.; fishing requires the appropriate South Dakota license.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"outdoor-campus-rapid-city","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"Outdoor Campus – Rapid City","title":"Explore exhibits and trails at Outdoor Campus","subtitle":"4130 Adventure Trail, Rapid City","notes":"Walk the nature trails, browse the habitat exhibits and aquarium, or register for a free public class when a suitable session is available.","short_summary":"State-run exhibits, trails, and free outdoor-skills classes.","evidence_claim":"South Dakota Game, Fish and Parks says Outdoor Campus has free educational classes, indoor exhibits, an aquarium, and nature trails for everyday use.","source_url":"https://gfp.sd.gov/toc-west/","source_title":"Outdoor Campus – Rapid City","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Programming is free;